2055|n|A large tree (Ficus Sycomorus) allied to the common fig. It is found in Egypt and Syria, and is the sycamore, or sycamine, of Scripture. ; The American plane tree, or buttonwood. ; A large European species of maple (Acer Pseudo-Platanus).	N:u4n,93,2;23gg,67,2~u4n,93,2;23gg,67,2
